(text "TWO-JOINT DIFFERENTIAL TX BANK - REVIEW CIRCUIT r0.1" (at 20.32 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "98fb4ada-bc94-5caa-8f18-953e25df42d3"))
(text "Repeat 3x for six joints. No PCB, external protection or system inhibit circuit is released.\nU1 pin map checked against TI SLLS103P Figure4-1 (PW16). Supply4.5-5.5V; logic VIH>=2V/VIL<=0.8V." (at 20.32 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b68a08a5-c023-5b33-b8fe-304708349562"))
(text "3.3V source required; no 5V pull-up on FPGA-connected nets. Inputs must not drive an unpowered U1.\nR1-R4 are initial source-damping provisions; R5-R9 force low with upstream high-Z. Re-evaluate SI in layout." (at 20.32 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c9ab1136-c5a8-5652-9326-8339940468fe"))
(text "Place C1 at U1 pins16/8.\nExternal SIGNAL_5V and GND\nare declared powered at J1.\nNo isolation in this circuit." (at 195.58 127 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f8b07070-9dbd-5b25-8efa-06f4c0286754"))
(text "G=0 and /G=1 -> differential outputs HIGH-Z. TX_PERMIT must come from qualified hardware permission.\nHIGH-Z is not guaranteed STEP-low at the remote drive: qualified receiver bias and drive inhibit are mandatory." (at 20.32 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "17927b30-716c-57f4-a480-8781844d156d"))
(text "J1/J2 are circuit boundaries,\nnot approved connector MPNs.\nMissing line protection,\nremote bias, power sequencing\nand cable qualification block release." (at 203.2 190.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a595927a-2ee9-5523-a6cb-fd988869d975"))
)
